OL,3,GNEWSAWoman released after child
OL,4,Acritically injured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was arrested after a crash
OL,7,Fin which a child sustaining critically
OL,8,Finjuries has been released on bail.
OL,10,FIt is understood that the injured child
OL,11,Fis still in a critical condition in
OL,12,Fhospital.
OL,14,FThe collision, involving two cars, one
OL,15,Fof which was towing a caravan, happened
OL,16,Fon the Cusher Road, outside Markethill,
OL,17,Fat about 13:20 GMT on Saturday.
